---
layout: default
title: Home
---

<style>
  /* 暖灰色配色方案 */
  :root {
    --primary-color: #8b9cb6;
    --secondary-color: #a3b1c6;
    --accent-color: #bbc6d6;
    --text-dark: #2c3540;
    --text-medium: #5a6471;
    --text-light: #7f8994;
    --bg-light: #f7f8fa;
    --shadow-soft: rgba(139, 156, 182, 0.08);
  }

  /* 简洁的英雄区域 */
  .hero {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0f3f7 0%, #e5eaf0 100%);
    color: var(--text-dark);
    padding: 100px 20px 80px;
    text-align: center;
    margin: -40px -40px 60px -40px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(139, 156, 182, 0.1);
  }

  .hero::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    background: 
      radial-gradient(circle at 30% 40%, rgba(139, 156, 182, 0.03) 0%, transparent 50%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 70% 70%, rgba(163, 177, 198, 0.03) 0%, transparent 50%);
  }

  .hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-size: 2.8em;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .hero .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.2em;
    margin-bottom: 35px;
    color: var(--text-medium);
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .cta-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn {
    padding: 12px 36px;
    border-radius: 24px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1em;
    transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--primary-color);
    color: white;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px var(--shadow-soft);
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(139, 156, 182, 0.15);
    background: #7a8ba3;
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    background: white;
    color: var(--primary-color);
    border: 2px solid var(--primary-color);
  }

  .btn-secondary:hover {
    background: var(--primary-color);
    color: white;
  }

  /* 简洁的特色区域 */
  .features {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 30px;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto 80px;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .feature-card {
    background: white;
    padding: 35px 28px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px var(--shadow-soft);
    transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    text-align: center;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--bg-light);
  }

  .feature-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(139, 156, 182, 0.12);
    border-top-color: var(--primary-color);
  }

  .feature-icon {
    font-size: 2.5em;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    display: inline-block;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .feature-card h3 {
    color: var(--text-dark);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    font-size: 1.35em;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .feature-card p {
    color: var(--text-medium);
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-size: 0.98em;
  }

  /* 最新成果区域 */
  .recent-section {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 80px auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 45px;
  }

  .section-header h2 {
    font-size: 2em;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    color: var(--text-dark);
  }

  .section-header p {
    color: var(--text-medium);
    font-size: 1.05em;
  }

  .publication-card {
    background: white;
    padding: 26px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px var(--shadow-soft);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    transition: all 0.3s;
    border-left: 3px solid transparent;
  }

  .publication-card:hover {
    border-left-color: var(--primary-color);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(139, 156, 182, 0.1);
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  .pub-title {
    font-size: 1.15em;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .pub-meta {
    color: var(--text-light);
    font-size: 0.9em;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .pub-abstract {
    color: var(--text-medium);
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-size: 0.95em;
  }

  /* 响应式 */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 2em;
    }

    .hero .subtitle {
      font-size: 1.05em;
    }

    .features {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .feature-card {
      padding: 28px 22px;
    }
  }

  /* 减少动画 */
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    * {
      animation: none !important;
      transition: none !important;
    }
  }
</style>

<!-- 简洁英雄区域 -->
<div class="hero">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <h1>Zhang Laboratory</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">
      The Zhang Laboratory is dedicated to the innovation of novel reaction methodologies. 
      We seek to discover molecular structure and reactivity that can contribute to 
      interdisciplinary solutions for challenges in human health.
    </p>
    <div class="cta-buttons">
      <a href="/research/" class="btn btn-primary">Our Research</a>
      <a href="/chemlib/" class="btn btn-secondary">Compound Library</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- 研究特色 -->
<div class="features">
  <div class="feature-card">
    <div class="feature-icon">🔬</div>
    <h3>Novel Synthesis</h3>
    <p>Developing cutting-edge synthetic routes for complex drug-like molecules with high efficiency and selectivity</p>
  </div>

  <div class="feature-card">
    <div class="feature-icon">💊</div>
    <h3>Drug Discovery</h3>
    <p>Rational design and optimization of bioactive compounds targeting critical disease pathways</p>
  </div>

  <div class="feature-card">
    <div class="feature-icon">🧬</div>
    <h3>Medicinal Chemistry</h3>
    <p>Structure-activity relationship studies and lead optimization for pharmaceutical development</p>
  </div>

  <div class="feature-card">
    <div class="feature-icon">🤖</div>
    <h3>Computational Tools</h3>
    <p>Machine learning and molecular modeling for reaction prediction and property optimization</p>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- 最新成果 -->
<div class="recent-section">
  <div class="section-header">
    <h2>Recent Publications</h2>
    <p>Latest advances from our laboratory</p>
  </div>

  <div class="publication-card">
    <div class="pub-title">
      Novel Synthetic Approach to Complex Heterocycles via Cascade Reactions
    </div>
    <div class="pub-meta">
      Nature Chemistry • 2024 • Impact Factor: 21.687
    </div>
    <div class="pub-abstract">
      We report a general strategy for the synthesis of polycyclic heterocycles through palladium-catalyzed cascade reactions...
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="publication-card">
    <div class="pub-title">
      Machine Learning-Guided Optimization of Drug-Like Compounds
    </div>
    <div class="pub-meta">
      Journal of Medicinal Chemistry • 2024 • Impact Factor: 7.446
    </div>
    <div class="pub-abstract">
      Integration of computational predictions with experimental validation accelerates lead optimization...
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 35px;">
    <a href="/publications/" class="btn btn-primary">View All Publications</a>
  </div>
</div>
